'''Grafaiai''' (Japanese: '''タギングル''' ''Taggingru'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

